string "item.tag.quest" "Quest"
string "maren.hello" "Thank the gods, swords. The dead came up through the crypt at dusk and the garrison ran. I am all that is left of it."
string "maren.ask.what" "What happened here?"
string "maren.ask.who" "Who are you?"
string "maren.ask.pay" "What does it pay?"
string "maren.leave" "Later."
string "maren.who" "Maren, castellan of Greywatch, keeper of its keys. Of its dead too, it seems, tonight."
string "maren.story" "The old warden sealed the crypt with his seal, and the seal lies in the chest before its door. Someone broke the lock. The dead walk while it is out."
string "maren.story2" "Put down what walks in my yard, and their captain with it. Then bring me the seal and I will close the crypt again."
string "maren.pay" "Fifty crowns from the keep's chest, and the warden's ring. He will not miss it."
string "maren.accept" "We'll do it."
string "maren.refuse" "Find other swords."
string "maren.accepted" "Go carefully. Their captain wore the warden's mail once. It still remembers how to fight."
string "maren.refused" "Then the gate is behind you. It will not hold them long."
string "maren.again" "You came back. Will you clear the yard?"
string "maren.remind" "{left} of the risen still walk, and their captain by the crypt door. I will hold the gate."
string "maren.fetch" "The yard is quiet. The seal is in the chest before the crypt door."
string "maren.report" "Is that the warden's seal? You found it."
string "maren.give" "Here. Close the crypt."
string "maren.thanks" "It is done. Greywatch owes you its walls tonight. Take the ring, and my thanks."
